{
  "name": "05 - Weekly Research Digest & Notifications",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 05 \u00b7 Research Digest & Notifications\nDaily 09:00 \u2192 active topics due today (frequency daily / weekly=Mon / monthly=1st) \u2192 new `summarized` papers with `digested = false` \u2192 AI overview (validated, falls back to plain list) \u2192 HTML email via Gmail.\n\u2714 sent \u2192 papers `digested = true`, row in `digest_log` (status sent)\n\u2716 Gmail failure \u2192 `digest_log` status failed, papers stay undigested \u2192 retried next run.\n**Credentials**: OpenAI \u00b7 Gmail.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 680
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -560
      ],
      "id": "1fc21f52-9a05-4dfa-ac4a-4ed6aa0e0a03",
      "name": "Note 0f9d35"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
